@startuml
!include style.puml
skinparam ArrowFontStyle plain
skinparam ParticipantFontColor #FFFFFF
skinparam maxMessageSize 180

participant "command:FilterUnlinkedCommand" as Command LOGIC_COLOR
participant ":ModelManager" as Model MODEL_COLOR

[-> Command : execute(model)
Command -> Model : updateFilteredDogList(unownedDogPredicate)
Command -> Model : updateFilteredCustomerList(noCustomersPredicate)
note right of Model
  Shows dogs with no owner and hides customers.
  The activity filter is unchanged.
  Stored records are unchanged.
end note
[<-- Command : commandResult

legend bottom
  Shows the dog form of filterun. Predicate evaluation is omitted.
  The customer form shows customers with no dogs and hides dogs.
  Parsing and saving follow the shared Logic flow.
  Successful execution only; validation failures are omitted.
endlegend
@enduml
